$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 3.2. Diastereoselective Mukaiyama aldol
reaction of cyclohexanones with acyclic ketene acetals Ethyl
(1-(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)cyclohexyl)acetate (4a) Ethyl ((1S*,
2R*)-2-allyl-1-(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)cyclohexyl)acetate (4c)
According to the synthetic procedure for 4a, this compound was obtained
in 90% yield (305.6 mg, 0.90 mmol) by the reaction of
2-allylcyclohexanone 2c (149 μL, 1.0 mmol) with
tert-butyl(1-ethoxyvinyloxy)dimethylsilane (304.0 mg, 1.5 mmol) in CH2Cl2
(2.0 mL) in the presence of Tf2CHCH2CHTf2 1 (0.29 mg, 0.5 μmol) for 2.5 h
at -178 °C. Colorless oil;. IR (neat) ν 2933, 2857, 1735, 1092, 1038,
835, 772 cm-1; 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 0.09 (3H, s), 0.12 (3H, s), 0.91
(9H, s), 1.03-1.35 (2H, m), 1.26 (3H, t, J = 7.1 Hz), 1.38-1.51 (2H, m),
1.52-1.91 (6H, m), 2.38 (1H,d, J = 12.9 Hz), 2.42-2.52 (1H, m), 2.88 (1H,
d, J = 12.9 Hz), 4.11 (2H, q, J = 7.1 Hz), 4.89-5.04 (2H, m), 5.66-5.84
(1H, m); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ -12.1 and -11.7, 14.2, 18.8, 21.8,
25.7, 26.1, 26.7, 34.6, 38.0, 43.7, 46.4, 60.3, 76.5, 115.3, 138.3,
170.7; MS (ESI-TOF) m/z 363 [M+Na]+; HRMS calcd for C19H36NaO3Si [M+Na]+,
363.2331; found, 363.2321. Anal. Calcd for C19H36O3Si: C, 67.01; H,
10.57. Found: C, 66.90; H, 10.71
