$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM A stirred solution of the above silyl enol ether (167.9 mg, 0.29 mmol)
and segment B (150 mg, 0.23 mmol) in dry CH2Cl2 (3 mL) was cooled to -78
°C to which BF3. OEt2 (13 μL, 0.14 mmol) was added dropwise. After 20
min, another portion of BF3. OEt2 (13 μL, 0.14 mmol) was added and the
mixture was stirred -78 °C for an additional hour. The reaction mixture
was treated with satd. NaHCO3, diluted with ether, and the aqueous layer
was extracted with ether. The combined organic layers were dried (MgSO4)
and concentrated in vacuo. The oily residue was purified by neutral
silica gel column chromatography (EtOAc/hexane 5%, 10%, 15%, then 20%) to
give 2 (235 mg, 87%) as a colourless oil. [α]D28 = -36.3° (c 1.9, CHCl3);
IR (neat) 3450 (br), 2932, 2858, 1713, 1620, 1086, 758, 702cm-1; 1 H, NMR
δ (400 MHz, CDCl3) 7.68 (4 H, dt, J = 8.0, 1.6 Hz, PhH), 7.40 (6 H, m,
PhH), 7.33 (1 H, d, J = 15.6Hz, 3-CH), 5.98 (1 H, dd, J = 7.6, 7.2 H,z,
5-CH), 5.79 (1 H, d, J = 16.0 Hz, 2-CH), 5.77 (1 H, m, 11-CH), 5.64 (1
H,br d, J = 10.4 Hz, 10-CH), 4.34 (2 H, br s, 9-CH, 19-CH), 4.07 (1 H,
dddd, J = 9.2, 5.6, 5.2, 2.4 Hz, 7-CH), 3.79 (1 H,dd, J = 10.8, 3.6 Hz,
21-CH), 3.74 (3 H, s, CO2Me), 3.73 (1 H, dd, J = 10.4, 6.0 Hz, 31-CHA),
3.66 (1 H, ddd, J = 6.4,6.0, 4.8 Hz, 15-CH), 3.60 (1 H, m, 13-CH), 3.57
(1 H, dd, J = 10.4, 6.4 Hz, 31-CHB), 3.39 (1 H, dd, J = 8.4, 4.0
Hz,29-CH), 3.32 (3 H, s, 15-CHOMe), 3.27 (3 H, s, 29-CHOMe), 3.19 (1 H,
d, J = 4.8 Hz, OH), 3.10 (1 H, dd, J = 6.0,5.6 Hz, 23-CH), 2.89 (1 H, dq,
J = 8.4, 6.8 Hz, 28-CH), 2.77 (1 H, dd, J = 17.2, 10.4 Hz, 18-CHA), 2.75
(1 H, qd, J =6.8, 4.0 Hz, 16-CH), 2.54 (1 H, ddd, J = 17.6, 10.4, 5.6 Hz,
26-CHA), 2.48 (1 H, dd, J = 17.2, 1.2 H,z, 18-CHB), 2.41(2 H, dd, J =
6.8, 6.0 Hz, 6-CH2), 2.40 (1 H, m, 26-CHB), 1.95 (3 H, m, 12-CH2, CH),
1.80 (1 H, m, CH), 1.77 (3 H, s,4-CMe), 1.76 (1 H, m, CH), 1.75 (1 H,
ddd, J = 14.4, 7.2, 6.0 Hz, 14-CHA), 1.66 (1 H, ddd, J = 14.4, 10.4, 2.4
Hz, 8-CHA), 1.60 (1 H, ddd, J = 14.4, 9.6, 4.0 Hz, 14-CHB), 1.55 (2 H, m,
2xCH), 1.40 (1 H, ddd, J = 14.0, 9.6, 3.2 H,z, 8-CHB), 1.38 (1 H, dddd, J
= 14.0, 9.6, 9.6, 4.8 Hz, CH), 1.35 (3 H, s, CMe2), 1.30 (3 H, s, CMe2),
1.12 (3 H, d, J = 6.8Hz, 16-CMe), 1.06 (9 H, s, SiPh2 tBu), 0.99 (3 H, d,
J = 7.2 H,z, 30-CMe), 0.91 (3 H, d, J = 6.8 Hz, 28-CMe), 0.90 (3 H, d, J
= 6.8 Hz, CMe), 0.89 (9 H, s, SiMe2 tBu), 0.85 (3 H, d, J = 6.8 Hz, CMe),
0.80 (3 H, d, J = 6.8 Hz, 20-CMe), 0.11 (3 H, s, SiMe), 0.09 (3 H, s,
