$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2) General Procedure for Vinylogous Mannich
Reactions Preparation of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9b) An oven-dried, 10-mL flask containing a solution of 42.3 mg (0.20
mmol, 1.0 equiv) of (E)- N-benzylidene-4-methoxyaniline (1b) and 1.70 mg
(0.002 mmol, 0.01 equiv) of chiral phosphoric acid (4b) in 2.0 mL of a
freshly prepared solvent mixture (iPrOH, tBuOH, 2- Me- 2-BuOH 1:1:1 and
1.0 eq H2O) was cooled to - 30°C. After one minute 160 mg (0.60 mmol, 3.0
equiv.) (Z)-1-[1-(tert-Butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-1,3-butadienyl]piperidine
(5d) was added dropwise. The resulting mixture was stirred rapidly for 7
days whereupon the solvent was removed in vacuo. The residue was purified
by silica gel chromatography (diethyl ether/petroleum ether, 8/1) to
afford 72 mg (99%; 90% ee) of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidine-
1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one (9b) as a colorless oil. e)
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-(4-fluorophenyl)-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9f) yield: 85%, reaction time: 9d, ee: 88%. [α]D24 = -24.1° (c = 1.08,
CHCl3). 1H-NMR(400 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 1.53 (m, 4 H, H16, H17), 1.63
(m, 2 H, H16'), 2.67 (dd, J = 7.0, 7.0 Hz, 2 H, H4), 3.36 (m, 2 H, H15),
3.56 (m, 2 H, H15'), 3.68 (s, 3 H, H14), 4.40 (m, 1 H, H5), 6.25 (d, J =
15.0 Hz, 1 H, H2), 6.46 (m, 2 H, H11), 6.67 (m, 2 H, H12), 6.71 (td, J =
7.0, 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H3), 6.99 (dd, J = 8.5 Hz, J = 8.5 Hz, 2 H, H8), 7.31
(dd, J = 5.5 Hz, J = 8.5 Hz, 2 H, H7). 13C-NMR(100 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d =
24.50 (C17), 25.44 (C16), 26.58 (C16'), 41.36 (C4), 43.01 (C15), 46.82
(C15'), 55.60 (C14), 57.56 (C5), 114.9 (d, J = 51.5 Hz, C8), 115.3 (C11),
115.5 (C12), 124.0 (C2), 128.0 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, C7), 138.4 (C6), 140.0
(C3), 140.4 (C10), 152.4 (C13), 161.9 (d, J = 245.5 Hz, C9), 164.8 (C1).
IR (Film): ν (cm-1) = 3337, 2998, 2937, 2856, 1727, 1657, 1605, 1511,
1441, 1351, 1237, 1180, 1155, 1139, 1125, 1104, 1088, 1040, 976, 876,
820, 787, 542. UV (MeCN): λmax (lg (ε)) = 207 (4.557), 245 (4.379), 312
(3.593). HR-MS (ESI): calcd. for C23H28FN2O2 ([M+H]+): 383,21293; found:
383.21346. calcd. for C23H27FN2O2Na ([M+Na]+): 405,19488; found:
405.19499. calcd. for C46H55F2N4O4 ([2M+H]+): 765,41859; found:
765.41938. calcd. for C46H54F2N4O4Na ([2M+Na]+): 787,40053; found:
787.40094. HPLC: Chiralcel OD column, solvent: n-hexane/i-propanol 4/1,
flow rate: 1.0 ml/min, UVdetection at 250 nm, major enantiomer tr = 15.5
min (9f), minor enantiomer tr = 28.9 min (ent- 9f).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, ee=88%, Mukaiyama-Mannich reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
