$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2) General Procedure for Vinylogous Mannich
Reactions Preparation of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9b) An oven-dried, 10-mL flask containing a solution of 42.3 mg (0.20
mmol, 1.0 equiv) of (E)- N-benzylidene-4-methoxyaniline (1b) and 1.70 mg
(0.002 mmol, 0.01 equiv) of chiral phosphoric acid (4b) in 2.0 mL of a
freshly prepared solvent mixture (iPrOH, tBuOH, 2- Me- 2-BuOH 1:1:1 and
1.0 eq H2O) was cooled to - 30°C. After one minute 160 mg (0.60 mmol, 3.0
equiv.) (Z)-1-[1-(tert-Butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-1,3-butadienyl]piperidine
(5d) was added dropwise. The resulting mixture was stirred rapidly for 7
days whereupon the solvent was removed in vacuo. The residue was purified
by silica gel chromatography (diethyl ether/petroleum ether, 8/1) to
afford 72 mg (99%; 90% ee) of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidine-
1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one (9b) as a colorless oil. b)
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-1-(piperidin-1-yl)-5-p-tolylpent-2-en-1-one
(9c) yield: 85%, reaction time: 10d, ee: 79%. [α]D24 = +3.8° (c = 1.05,
CHCl3). 1H-NMR(300 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 1.52 (m, 4 H, H17, H18), 1.61
(m, 2 H, H17'), 2.30 (s, 3 H, H10), 2.67 (ddd, J = 6.5, 6.5 Hz, 2.0 Hz, 2
H, H4), 3.35 (m, 2 H, H16), 3.56 (m, 2 H, H16'), 3.67 (s, 3 H, H15), 4.38
(t, J = 6.5 Hz, 1 H, H5), 6.25 (d, J = 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H2), 6.48 (m, 2 H,
H12), 6.67 (m, 2 H, H13), 6.73 (td, J = 6.5, 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H3), 7.11 (d,
J = 8.0 Hz, 2 H, H8), 7.22 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 2 H, H7). 13C-NMR(100 MHz,
CDCl3, 26°C): d = 20.95 (C10), 24.47 (C18), 25.41 (C17), 26.52 (C17'),
41.32 (C4), 42.94 (C16), 46.78 (C16'), 55.57 (C15), 57.75 (C5), 114.6
(C12), 114.9 (C13), 123.7 (C2), 126.3 (C7), 129.2 (C8), 136.6 (C9), 139.8
(C6), 140.5 (C3), 140.9 (C11), 152.1 (C14), 164.9 (C1). IR (Film): ν
(cm-1) = 3341, 2999, 2937, 2856, 1656, 1610, 1512, 1440, 1237, 1179,
1139, 1124, 1039, 976, 852, 819, 787, 540. UV (MeCN): λmax (lg (ε)) = 211
(4.606), 244 (4.499), 312 (3.753). HR-MS (ESI): calcd. for C24H31N2O2
([M+H]+): 379.23800; found: 379.23790. calcd. for C24H30N2O2Na ([M+Na]+):
401.21995; found: 401.21990. calcd. for C48H61N4O4 ([2M+H]+): 757.46873;
found: 757.46909. calcd. for C48H60N4O4Na ([2M+Na]+): 779.45068; found:
779.44993. HPLC: Chiralcel OD column, solvent: n-hexane/i-propanol 4/1,
flow rate: 1.0 ml/min, UVdetection at 250 nm, major enantiomer tr = 13.3
min (9c), minor enantiomer tr = 22.0 min (ent-9c).
